OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely dry with sunny spells to
OL,6,Fstart but feeling cold. Scattered
OL,7,FNorth Sea showers spread inland from
OL,8,Fmid-morning, these continuing to feed
OL,9,Fin through the day bringing variable
OL,10,Fconditions and cloudier periods.
OL,11,FShowers could turn wintry at times
OL,12,Fover hills.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers easing this evening
OL,15,Fwith frost developing in places. Then
OL,16,Fpersistent rain spreading
OL,17,Fnortheastwards overnight, reaching all
OL,18,Fparts by Tuesday morning and falling
OL,19,Fas sleet or snow over high ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
