OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy, cold and wet day
OL,6,Fwith persistent rain and some strong
OL,7,Fwinds. Sleet or snow continuing to
OL,8,Ffall on hills until late morning with
OL,9,Fsome accumulations likely here.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FChangeable, with periods of rain on
OL,13,FWednesday. Eventually drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter on Thursday after early rain.
OL,15,FLargely dry Friday but a chance of
OL,16,Fshowers. Temperatures below normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
